WEBVTT

00:30.950 --> 00:33.270
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.290 --> 00:36.270
[Episode 9: Truth as Bait]

00:45.500 --> 00:47.360
The pool water has dropped again.

00:47.470 --> 00:48.680
The spiritual power isn't increasing,

00:48.680 --> 00:50.640
but the evil power is
popping up everywhere.

00:50.640 --> 00:51.880
If this continues,

00:52.110 --> 00:54.710
I'm afraid we won't
survive this rainy season.

00:54.880 --> 00:56.280
I was on duty yesterday.

00:56.670 --> 00:58.640
When I got close to the evil power rift,

00:58.640 --> 00:59.560
the force was

00:59.920 --> 01:01.840
ten times fiercer than usual.

01:05.000 --> 01:06.000
Freshly tainted?

01:06.510 --> 01:07.760
While washing clothes,

01:07.760 --> 01:09.760
I accidentally got it on my forearm.

01:10.680 --> 01:12.680
I hope Lady Fufeng can hold on.

01:12.950 --> 01:14.400
If even she...

01:17.039 --> 01:17.640
Master.

01:17.840 --> 01:18.840
That Young Magistrate

01:18.840 --> 01:20.480
took the selected scrolls early
this morning

01:20.480 --> 01:22.840
and went down the mountain
back to the county yamen.

01:22.840 --> 01:23.710
I see.

01:24.200 --> 01:25.840
He put on a good act,

01:26.070 --> 01:27.530
but he left just like that.

01:28.560 --> 01:30.490
I didn't expect him to do anything.

01:33.640 --> 01:37.259
That day, I noticed that the evil power
in Kuquan Valley was restless.

01:37.259 --> 01:39.190
I'm afraid something will happen.

01:39.840 --> 01:41.759
Lead all the spirit envoys

01:42.039 --> 01:43.940
and the spirits of Xiqianhua
to suppress it.

01:43.940 --> 01:45.200
You must hold the line.

01:46.640 --> 01:49.870
Then, are you going to be alright

01:50.430 --> 01:51.360
if you are alone?

01:52.350 --> 01:53.000
It's okay.

01:53.920 --> 01:54.789
Go ahead.

01:55.560 --> 01:56.150
Yes.

02:24.000 --> 02:25.000
Clumsy.

02:28.910 --> 02:29.910
Am I not handsome?

02:33.710 --> 02:34.840
I'm sorry, Lord Bai.

02:35.670 --> 02:37.079
I was reckless.

02:39.190 --> 02:40.840
Sorry, I was just upset.

02:45.800 --> 02:47.560
Is something bothering you?

02:47.910 --> 02:48.800
Nothing.

02:52.710 --> 02:53.370
Let me do it.

02:56.910 --> 02:58.640
If you are worried about cases,

02:58.710 --> 02:59.520
you can ask me.

03:00.000 --> 03:01.520
I know everything,

03:01.960 --> 03:03.080
from humans to demons,

03:03.080 --> 03:04.340
in Yin-Yang Crossing.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.360
Really?

03:05.590 --> 03:06.190
Of course.

03:06.360 --> 03:09.080
Then, if demons get hurt,
how should they get treated?

03:09.080 --> 03:10.430
If they get hurt,

03:10.560 --> 03:12.760
they must be treated with demonic arts.

03:13.510 --> 03:14.800
It also depends on the situation.

03:14.800 --> 03:16.150
Whether it's an injury

03:16.150 --> 03:18.190
or they got possessed during cultivation.

03:18.190 --> 03:20.630
Your question is too amateur.

03:21.560 --> 03:23.829
What if their spiritual power is damaged?

03:23.829 --> 03:25.470
What medicine should be used?

03:25.470 --> 03:26.120
Medicine?

03:27.560 --> 03:30.560
There should be
spiritual power replenishment.

03:32.470 --> 03:34.400
Treating like with like, you know.

03:34.800 --> 03:36.329
The medicine we humans take

03:36.430 --> 03:37.870
is useless for demons.

03:38.630 --> 03:40.470
But I read in the ancient records

03:40.800 --> 03:43.200
that some medicines are useful for demons.

03:44.240 --> 03:46.030
Could it be a deceptive book?

03:51.190 --> 03:52.430
You haven't read any books anyway.

03:52.430 --> 03:53.690
Asking you is useless.

03:54.920 --> 03:56.440
What do you mean?

03:57.190 --> 03:57.870
Besides,

03:58.360 --> 03:59.560
look at my movements.

03:59.910 --> 04:01.440
It's obvious I'm a warrior.

04:15.560 --> 04:16.630
What are you doing?

04:17.870 --> 04:18.930
Brewing medicine.

04:38.270 --> 04:40.130
Do you think the medicine you brew

04:40.840 --> 04:42.080
can cure demons?

04:43.950 --> 04:45.800
I went to your secret room

04:45.940 --> 04:47.680
and found some records related to demons.

04:47.680 --> 04:49.190
I found some spiritual medicines

04:49.190 --> 04:51.050
that have miraculous effects on
restoring spiritual power.

04:51.050 --> 04:52.800
So, I brewed some to try.

04:55.040 --> 04:56.840
You have a lot of spare time, huh?

04:58.900 --> 04:59.950
Don't worry, My Lady.

04:59.950 --> 05:01.560
I didn't delay any official business.

05:01.560 --> 05:04.560
There are just
a few disputes among spirits

05:04.650 --> 05:05.920
that I'm not sure about.

05:05.920 --> 05:08.310
I'll wait until you recover
to make a decision.

05:08.310 --> 05:10.800
So, please take your medicine.

05:11.160 --> 05:14.020
You can't abandon
the people of Yin-Yang Crossing.

05:15.750 --> 05:16.600
Take a look.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.320
Don't waste your effort.

05:32.720 --> 05:34.380
Even if you brew ten more pots,

05:34.630 --> 05:36.290
it's just a drop in the bucket.

05:36.640 --> 05:38.230
It smells bad,

05:38.510 --> 05:39.800
but it's effective.

05:40.450 --> 05:42.180
You'd better drink it, My Lady.

05:45.560 --> 05:48.270
I'm a mortal with a lifespan of
several decades.

05:48.780 --> 05:50.780
I'm only working here temporarily.

05:50.870 --> 05:52.480
I don't know what arrangements

05:52.480 --> 05:53.870
the court will have for me later.

05:53.870 --> 05:54.750
So, My Lady,

05:54.950 --> 05:57.040
you can't pin your hopes on me.

05:57.390 --> 05:59.800
Since you have guarded Yin-Yang Crossing
for thousands of years,

05:59.800 --> 06:01.460
you must continue to guard it.

06:04.870 --> 06:05.830
Bai Shanjun.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.450
Are you really willing to stay?

06:11.290 --> 06:12.600
I decocted medicine and served you

06:12.600 --> 06:14.040
willingly.

06:14.720 --> 06:17.040
Please don't give up.

06:54.070 --> 06:54.530
My Lady.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.970
This is another prescription.

06:59.950 --> 07:00.800
Taste it.

07:11.370 --> 07:12.370
It's very bitter.

07:13.030 --> 07:14.960
Why didn't you put some honey in it?

07:15.560 --> 07:16.120
I will.

07:30.870 --> 07:31.330
My Lady.

07:32.190 --> 07:33.240
The light is so dim

07:33.750 --> 07:34.750
that it upsets me.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.780
Bring that candlestick over.

07:37.920 --> 07:38.390
Okay.

07:46.430 --> 07:47.430
My legs are sore.

07:47.750 --> 07:48.510
Lord Bai,

07:49.070 --> 07:50.730
could you massage them for me?

07:50.830 --> 07:51.480
Okay.

07:57.700 --> 07:58.159
My Lady,

07:58.330 --> 08:00.730
it is inappropriate for a man
to touch a woman.

08:00.730 --> 08:02.120
I will find a wooden mallet tomorrow

08:02.120 --> 08:03.360
to massage your legs.

08:04.390 --> 08:05.270
Bai Shanjun,

08:06.360 --> 08:08.020
you seem to care about me a lot.

08:12.510 --> 08:12.970
My Lady,

08:13.630 --> 08:15.090
everyone cares about you.

08:17.630 --> 08:19.030
When you first came here,

08:19.630 --> 08:20.750
you looked gentle,

08:21.360 --> 08:23.420
but you were actually very stubborn.

08:23.800 --> 08:24.920
Now it seems

08:25.870 --> 08:27.560
you have became gentler.

08:28.680 --> 08:29.270
My Lady,

08:29.650 --> 08:30.930
when we first met,

08:31.020 --> 08:32.250
you wanted to kill me.

08:32.480 --> 08:33.909
If I weren't tough enough,

08:33.909 --> 08:35.710
I would probably be ashes by now.

08:43.150 --> 08:43.630
My Lady.

08:54.320 --> 08:55.320
Bai Shanjun,

08:57.120 --> 08:58.030
what if...

08:58.150 --> 08:58.440
My Lady,

08:58.440 --> 08:58.720
I...

08:59.300 --> 09:00.480
There are no what-ifs.

09:00.480 --> 09:02.280
You will definitely get better.

09:42.720 --> 09:43.270
My Lady.

09:45.550 --> 09:46.120
My Lady?

10:56.320 --> 10:58.170
[May Lady Fufeng recover.
From Bai Shanjun.]

10:59.550 --> 11:00.120
My Lady.

11:01.690 --> 11:03.020
I pray to you,

11:03.670 --> 11:05.330
wishing for your good health.

11:05.910 --> 11:07.360
Is it strange?

11:10.300 --> 11:11.780
But don't you fulfill

11:12.270 --> 11:13.870
all the wishes of the people?

11:15.270 --> 11:16.270
I, Bai Shanjun,

11:17.170 --> 11:18.740
am also one of your people.

11:19.930 --> 11:20.720
My Lady,

11:22.030 --> 11:23.720
can you fulfill my wish?

11:37.960 --> 11:38.840
Who is there?

11:54.510 --> 11:55.230
Who are you?

11:56.960 --> 11:57.720
Me?

11:58.640 --> 11:59.760
I am you.

12:02.480 --> 12:03.480
Have you been

12:03.590 --> 12:04.950
looking for this?

12:08.150 --> 12:09.390
Look closely.

12:09.630 --> 12:11.160
Is this the answer you want?

12:11.960 --> 12:13.160
Stop playing tricks!

12:13.720 --> 12:15.630
How could there be two of me
in this world?

12:15.630 --> 12:16.720
Who exactly are you?

12:16.720 --> 12:17.650
What do you want?

12:17.990 --> 12:19.110
How stubborn.

12:20.910 --> 12:23.150
I have been patient enough with you,

12:23.510 --> 12:25.750
but you ruined my plans time and again.

13:07.600 --> 13:09.060
It's been a hundred years,

13:09.360 --> 13:12.490
and you still only use
these sneaky, despicable tricks,

13:12.910 --> 13:13.720
Bai Han.

13:21.410 --> 13:23.070
You were faking your illness.

13:23.360 --> 13:24.910
Realizing it now

13:25.890 --> 13:27.090
is probably too late.

13:27.440 --> 13:29.440
Lead all the spirit envoys

13:29.750 --> 13:31.730
and the spirits of Xiqianhua
to suppress it.

13:31.730 --> 13:32.990
You must hold the line.

13:34.510 --> 13:37.750
Then, is it okay for you

13:38.310 --> 13:39.190
to be alone?

13:40.270 --> 13:41.030
It's okay.

13:41.840 --> 13:42.720
Go ahead.

14:01.390 --> 14:02.600
You little spirit.

14:03.520 --> 14:04.790
You are still alive?

14:05.270 --> 14:06.670
Lady Fufeng anticipated

14:06.960 --> 14:08.720
that you would kill me after using me,

14:08.720 --> 14:10.690
so she made a substitute
with her spiritual power

14:10.690 --> 14:12.350
to lure you into devouring it.

14:12.480 --> 14:13.480
What you devoured

14:13.790 --> 14:16.240
was just a bait made of
My Lady's pure spiritual power.

14:16.240 --> 14:16.870
Bai Han,

14:17.270 --> 14:18.030
stop it.

14:18.750 --> 14:19.910
Fine.

14:45.510 --> 14:46.570
My Lord and My Lady.

14:48.630 --> 14:49.750
I have paid for

14:51.790 --> 14:52.720
what I owed you.

15:09.510 --> 15:10.480
She has always felt guilty

15:10.480 --> 15:12.390
for almost hurting you that day.

15:12.870 --> 15:15.000
Just consider it her compensation.

15:15.220 --> 15:17.950
But there was no need to
compensate with her life.

15:18.840 --> 15:21.300
Though the mirror is broken,
it can be fixed.

15:22.030 --> 15:23.360
Can she come back?

15:33.270 --> 15:35.470
Don't be afraid, little bronze mirror.

15:36.480 --> 15:37.600
This place

15:38.240 --> 15:39.770
is full of spiritual power.

15:43.150 --> 15:44.670
In less than a hundred years,

15:44.670 --> 15:46.870
you'll be able to take human form again.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.150
My Lady,

16:02.630 --> 16:04.780
the one who stole your heart
a hundred years ago

16:04.780 --> 16:05.840
was Bai Han, right?

16:13.150 --> 16:14.360
Did you get it back?

16:26.070 --> 16:26.950
Will you die?

16:35.480 --> 16:37.610
There's no point discussing this now.

16:40.910 --> 16:42.170
Bai Han is still alive,

16:42.200 --> 16:44.460
hiding somewhere in Yin-Yang Crossing.

16:44.550 --> 16:45.860
I must lure him out to

16:46.390 --> 16:48.150
eliminate the root of the problem.

16:48.150 --> 16:48.960
So,

16:50.580 --> 16:53.180
your injury and being bedridden
were all fake.

16:55.270 --> 16:55.670
Yes.

16:57.150 --> 16:58.720
Why didn't you tell me?

16:59.360 --> 17:00.270
Bai Shanjun,

17:00.840 --> 17:02.150
if I told you everything,

17:02.150 --> 17:03.750
other than making you worry,

17:04.030 --> 17:05.359
what would be the point?

17:07.680 --> 17:08.240
Fine.

17:09.440 --> 17:10.829
Since you're fine, My Lady,

17:10.829 --> 17:13.680
I won't disturb you anymore.

17:25.680 --> 17:26.270
My Lady,

17:28.030 --> 17:29.750
I'm angry that you deceived me,

17:29.750 --> 17:31.680
watching me run around like a fool.

17:31.890 --> 17:32.540
I know

17:32.920 --> 17:34.920
little about Yin-Yang Crossing
and evil power,

17:34.920 --> 17:36.960
so I understand why
you didn't tell me the truth.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.590
But I never wanted you to die.

17:45.310 --> 17:46.110
It's good

17:47.160 --> 17:48.160
that you're fine.

17:59.510 --> 18:01.160
Though you're not a fool,

18:01.880 --> 18:03.070
you're a nerd.

18:04.200 --> 18:06.550
Why did Bai Han choose you

18:07.160 --> 18:08.270
to be his vessel?

18:11.590 --> 18:12.200
Master,

18:12.790 --> 18:13.790
has the evil power

18:14.030 --> 18:15.200
dissipated?

18:16.350 --> 18:17.350
I felt that

18:17.960 --> 18:19.750
it went a bit too smoothly.

18:20.750 --> 18:21.640
Smoothly?

18:23.030 --> 18:24.750
If the evil power is
dispersed in one place,

18:24.750 --> 18:26.550
it will return from another.

18:26.880 --> 18:28.510
In the past hundred years, Bai Han

18:28.510 --> 18:30.710
must have learned many wicked methods.

18:31.440 --> 18:33.640
He's harder to deal with than I thought.

18:33.680 --> 18:34.270
Then,

18:35.400 --> 18:37.750
can we take back

18:38.270 --> 18:40.670
the half tree heart
in Bai Shanjun's chest?

18:42.200 --> 18:43.730
It's not the right time yet.

18:59.960 --> 19:01.820
Send someone to the capital to ask

19:02.160 --> 19:03.310
if the person in the painting

19:03.310 --> 19:04.200
is really

19:04.200 --> 19:07.480
the county magistrate demoted
from the capital to Yin-Yang Crossing,

19:07.480 --> 19:08.550
Bai Shanjun.

19:10.550 --> 19:10.960
Yes.

19:22.090 --> 19:26.680
[May Lady Fufeng recover.
From Bai Shanjun.]

19:32.440 --> 19:33.440
Thank you.
